<view class="container">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-eyebrow">
      <view class="hero-bar"></view>
      <text>家庭邀请码</text>
      <view class="hero-bar"></view>
    </view>
    <view class="code-card" bindtap="onCopy" hover-class="press">
      <text class="code-text">{{ code }}</text>
      <view class="code-hint">
        <text class="code-hint-glyph">⧉</text>
        <text>轻触复制</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="hero-tip">将此码分享给家人，输入后即可加入家庭共享账本。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="footer">
    <view class="regen-btn" bindtap="onRegenerate" hover-class="press">
      <text class="regen-label">重新生成邀请码</text>
    </view>
    <text class="regen-warn">重新生成后旧码立即失效，请先通知所有家人。</text>
  </view>
</view>
